<div class="rk-error-page">
  <div class="rk-error-wrap">
    <div class="rk-auth-brand">
      <div class="rk-logomark"><span>R</span></div>
      <span class="rk-brand-name">Renkley</span>
    </div>

    <div class="rk-card rk-border rk-shadow rk-error-panel">
      <span class="rk-kicker">Unbuilt</span>
      <p class="rk-error-meta">File No. 404 — Unassigned</p>

      <h1 class="rk-error-title">You have reached a door that was never built.</h1>

      <p>You followed the sign correctly. The corridor exists, the light switch
        works, and the floor is solid beneath you — and yet the room behind this
        door was never furnished. No architect finished the plans, and it is
        doubtful now that one will.</p>

      <p>This is not a punishment, and no application will change it. It is simply
        the truth of the building, stated plainly, so that you need not wonder
        any further, or file an appeal with an office that would only misplace
        it.</p>

      <p>You are welcome to try the handle again later. Buildings do, on occasion,
        grow new rooms.</p>

      <div class="rk-error-divider"></div>

      <%= render "landing/cta_button",
      variant: :lg,
      cta_label: "Return to the rooms that are finished →",
      cta_href: overview_path %>
    </div>

    <footer class="rk-error-footer">Renkley Registry of Incomplete Rooms · recorded, not resolved</footer>
  </div>
</div>
